invalid type: string "**Where is it:** South-West Facing Garden Planter, with a high fence behind. \n\n⚠\u{fe0f}***Warning Signs:** Lack of flowers usually means it isn't getting enough hours of direct sunlight.*\n\n## 🌻Outdoor Annuals\n\n#### 🌿Sunflowers\n\n**Light:** 6-8 hours of direct, unobstructed sun.\n\nl sun for the sweetest fruit.\n\nt\0s\0=\0=\02\0.\03\03\0.\01\0\n\0\n\0r\0e\0q\0